{"id":"fallecido","lemma":"fallecido","pos":"adj","rank":4431,"glosses":["deceased, departed"],"ipa":"/faʝeˈθido/","forms":{"feminine":"fallecida","masculinePlural":"fallecidos","femininePlural":"fallecidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-fallecido.wav","examples":[{"text":"No sabía que tu padre había fallecido.","en":"I didn't know your father had passed away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585840","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"father, parent"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},null]},{"text":"Eres afortunado al no haber fallecido.","en":"You're lucky you didn't die.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"lucky, fortunate"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have"},null]},{"text":"Se erigió un monumento en memoria de los fallecidos.","en":"A monument was erected in memory of the deceased.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693337","words":[{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"monument"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"memory"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"El emperador rezó por las almas de los fallecidos.","en":"The Emperor prayed for the souls of the deceased.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"emperor"},{"g":"to pray","l":"rezar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"soul","l":"alma"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}